Role::OpenAICompatible::default_embedding_model is text-embedding-3-large (OpenAICompatible.pm:124). Mistral (Engine/Mistral.pm, composes Embedding) and Scaleway (Engine/Scaleway.pm:9) do not override it. Verified offline: Mistral->new(api_key=>"k")->embedding("x") body {"input":"x","model":"text-embedding-3-large"}; Scaleway same. Neither provider serves that id -> a 4xx for anyone relying on the default. The live test hides it by passing embedding_model=>"mistral-embed" (t/82_live_embedding.t:102).

Fix: Mistral sub default_embedding_model { "mistral-embed" } (confident). Scaleway: pick a current Generative APIs embedding model (last known: bge-multilingual-gemma2; newer qwen3-embedding-* may exist) — verify against Scaleway docs via langertha-llm-advisor before choosing. Add request-building tests (t/21_embedding_requests.t) asserting the default model for each embedding engine.

